AwomoPaw

AwomoPaw extensions and modifications are maintained in this repository.
The external base is QwenPaw, https://github.com/agentscope-ai/QwenPaw,
revision e6e0dcd85b11212d3bf945a724adc295baa03902, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The base project's license and attribution are preserved in LICENSE and
source/LICENSE. The complete upstream framework, including unmodified source
and documentation, is vendored under source/ together with AwomoPaw changes.
The historical modification patch remains under patches/ for provenance.
